      "texte_en": "### 🎯 Pre-RSI Reliability — Bootstrap Analysis\n\n*5000 resamples (Thompson, 2000)*\n\n| Indicator | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **Pre-RSI score** | **62 / 100** |\n| 80% confidence interval | [57.1 – 67.6] |\n| 90% confidence interval | [55.6 – 69] |\n| Signal stability | Très stable (±4 pts) |\n| Robust signal | ✅ Yes |\n\n**Interpretation:** The Pre-RSI of **62/100** is statistically robust — even when varying the assumptions, the signal remains **bullish**.\n\n> *Bootstrap estimates score robustness against measurement uncertainty in each component. A narrow IC90 indicates a reliable signal.*\n\n"
